From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pessi-v <pessimo@posteo.net>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:54:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] (lilac) defconfig: enable the run-queue statistics

The vendor interrupt balancer msm_irqbalance reads
/sys/devices/system/cpu/cpu0/rq-stats. Without CONFIG_QCOM_RUN_QUEUE_STATS
it exits immediately and init restarts it every 5 s; with it, it stays
running and spreads the interrupts across the CPUs.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/aosp_yoshino_lilac_defconfig |    2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/aosp_yoshino_lilac_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/aosp_yoshino_lilac_defconfig
index a6181e0c93704b3130588bc43773ffc0ba4e8ee3..afeaee1f5b1131094d924a9fd64528f8da1b62ea 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/aosp_yoshino_lilac_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/aosp_yoshino_lilac_defconfig
@@ -931,3 +931,5 @@ CONFIG_BT_BNEP=y
 CONFIG_BT_BNEP_MC_FILTER=y
 CONFIG_BT_BNEP_PROTO_FILTER=y
 CONFIG_BT_HIDP=y
+# msm_irqbalance reads the run-queue statistics; without them it exits at start
+CONFIG_QCOM_RUN_QUEUE_STATS=y
